! ----------------------------------------------------------
! Basis set: pob-tzvp-rev2 ECPs
! Effective core potentials carried by the pob-TZVP-rev2 records for Rb-Po
! and La-Lu (CRYSTAL Z+200 convention), converted from the Bredow-group
! per-element sources in python/vibeqc/basis_library/sources/pob-TZVP-rev2/
! by vibeqc.basis_crystal.emit_ecp_sidecar. The channels are exactly the
! primitive arrays vibeqc.basis_crystal.crystal_ecp_to_libecpint_arrays
! feeds libecpint on the periodic route, so molecular and periodic runs use
! one ECP.
! Originating publication: D. Vilela Oliveira, J. Laun, M. F. Peintinger,
!   T. Bredow, J. Comput. Chem. 40, 2364 (2019); DOI: 10.1002/jcc.26013
! ECP parameters: Stuttgart-Cologne energy-consistent pseudopotentials as
!   distributed with the pob-TZVP-rev2 basis (see the per-element source
!   files and the pob-TZVP-rev2 paper for the per-element references).
! Source URL: https://www.chemie.uni-bonn.de/bredow/de/software/ (pob-tzvp-rev2
!   Rb-I, Cs-Po and La-Lu archives), retrieved 2026-09-05
! License: numerical parameter data from published scientific papers;
!   redistribution is standard practice (see python/vibeqc/data_library/README.md)
! ----------------------------------------------------------
!
